    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Beastmaster",
    "summary": "In [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), as this unit is **selected to fight**, you can Empower it by spending 1 [Pain token](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). While it is Empowered and contains a **BEASTMASTER** model, the **BEAST** models in it can re-roll their **Hit rolls** and **Wound rolls** for melee attacks.",
